    Add multi-insider scaling multiplier (15/25/35/50)
    
    Score now scales with the count of DISTINCT insider wallets:
      1 -> +15 Insider Tracked      3 -> +35 Strong Cabal Cluster
      2 -> +25 Dual Insider Cluster 4+ -> +50 Cabal Swarm
    
    Counting is of unique addresses, not list lengths. The three detection
    sources overlap heavily — a wallet can be watchlisted AND early AND
    co-funded — so a single wallet would otherwise have scored as three.
    
    FIXED A GATE LEAK found while testing: the bonus was gated on
    safetyGateFailed, which is false for an UNVERIFIED audit, so a 4-wallet
    swarm added +50 to a token whose contract was never verified. The
    UNVERIFIED score cap masked it, which is precisely why it mattered — a
    later change to that cap would have silently reopened it. The multiplier
    now requires audit.status === PASSED affirmatively.
    
    Verified: PASSED+swarm = 100/BUY SIGNAL, FAILED = 0/+0, UNVERIFIED = +0,
    sub-150 holders = 0/+0.
    
    Telegram: header escalates to CABAL SWARM at 4+ and MULTI-INSIDER at 2+;
    per-insider lines carry spend, entry MC, timing and a Solscan link.
    
    Note the bonus is ADDITIVE, not a score floor: a swarm lands at base+50
    clamped to 100, so a token with weak demand and thin liquidity will not
    reach 90 on insider count alone. Four wallets buying something illiquid is
    a reason to look, not a reason to override the market data.
    
